### [LIST] All reviews for a user
GET http://localhost:8081/user/reviews?userId=697a39e7bb361ffd9cdb8bbf

### [LIST] Missing userId → 400
GET http://localhost:8081/user/reviews

### [LIST] Invalid userId → 400
GET http://localhost:8081/user/reviews?userId=not-an-object-id

### [DELETE] Delete a review (replace REVIEW_ID_HERE with a real _id)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/user/reviews/69c6a80677e7e5965deca23f?userId=697a39e7bb361ffd9cdb8bbf

### [DELETE] Invalid reviewId → 400
DELETE http://localhost:8081/user/reviews/not-an-id?userId=697a39e7bb361ffd9cdb8bbf

### [DELETE] Wrong userId → 404
DELETE http://localhost:8081/user/reviews/REVIEW_ID_HERE?userId=000000000000000000000000
